  "description": {
    "ja": {
      "source": "Wikipedia 日本語版「タチナタマメ」",
      "source_url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%BF%E3%83%81%E3%83%8A%E3%82%BF%E3%83%9E%E3%83%A1",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 108498752,
      "text": "タチナタマメ（立鉈豆）はマメ亜科の一年草。ヨウナタマメ（洋刀豆）とも呼ばれる。西インド諸島原産。学名はCanavalia ensiformis。英語名はJack-bean。飼料や人間の食料として利用される。ブラジルではfeijão-de-porco（ブタの豆）と呼ばれる。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia 英語版「Canavalia ensiformis」",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Canavalia_ensiformis",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 1313935778,
      "text": "Canavalia ensiformis is a legume which is used for animal fodder and human nutrition, especially in Brazil where it is called feijão-de-porco. It is also the source of concanavalin A."
    }
  },
